  "title": "Scotch Eggs with Mustard Sauce",
  "description": "Scotch eggs with mustard sauce are part of the traditional Scottish breakfast. They can be served hot with gravy at teatime or cold as a snack.",
  "authors": [
    "Karen"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:05:28-04:00",
